            <ArticleTitle>Interscalene block for pain relief after shoulder surgery. A prospective randomized study.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>22-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A prospective randomized study undertaken in 30 patients who underwent outpatient decompressive acromioplasty demonstrated the efficacy and safety of interscalene block post-operatively. Interscalene block improved the postoperative condition and well being of these patients. Their use decreased the hospitalization rate. There were no complications or side effects.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
